      "side": 1,
      "message": "The detection only takes dns timeout happened in last mValidDataStallDnsTimeThreshold ms into consideration. e.g. Only consider the last 30 minutes dns timeout events. That\u0027s why I called it valid time. Events happened longer time ago are regarded as not useless information.",
