        "id": 1304263
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-13T10:43:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it should not be 0 in general case. Just in case if someone would like to disable this by setting the threshold to 0(though it should be configured via other setting). Since the caller is NetworkMonitor, NetworkMonitor will crash if it throw IllegalArgumentException. It sounds dangerous that someone could crash NetworkMonitor by setting the setting to improper value. I could add a error log here. Is that ok to you? or it\u0027s preferred to throw an IllegalArgumentException?",
      "parentUuid": "f8e4b366_dda6a372",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1541,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 1541,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "cf11ee0859b39ede04a4a1359437732dc0a4f5ac",
